From fbd47f0560e63b35f299594407923126acd61f44 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 09:48:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Apply light pink-lavender page background theme across the
 app
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Swaps the neutral grey page background (#f5f5f7 / #F1F3F6 / #f5f5f5 /
#f8f4f8) for a soft pink-lavender tint (#f8ecf6) everywhere a screen
sets its own background, and updates the central --bg CSS variable in
index.css so every dealer/customer screen already using the shared
.screen/#phone wrapper (Dashboard, Ledger, Cart, Catalogue, Profile,
Schemes, Support, etc.) and the whole Admin shell (.admin-app) pick it
up automatically.

Screens updated directly (each hardcoded its own background instead of
inheriting from --bg): Login, Store (guest/customer), MyAccount,
TrackOrder, ContactSupport, StaffHome, and every staff screen
(SalesDashboard, MyDealersPage, DuesToCollectPage, DayCheckIn,
Attendance, ComingSoon, DealerDetail, FieldDealerDetail, TeamAccess).

Purple brand accent (#7B2D8B) and all semantic colors (danger/success/
warning) are unchanged — this only touches the page-background layer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GxWPdEf21EL6SvRpGBbX8q
